}
`;

exports[`password-change-code > matches the snapshot 1`] = `
{
  "subject": "Your HEAT password change code",
  "text": "HEAT

Hello Amina,

Use this code to confirm your password change:

482910

The code expires in 15 minutes.

If you did not ask for this, change your password and tell support.

Questions? Write to support@heat.example.",
}
`;

exports[`password-reset > matches the snapshot 1`] = `
{
  "subject": "Reset your HEAT password",
  "text": "HEAT

Hello Amina,

We received a request to reset your password.

Choose a new password: https://learn.heat.example/reset-password/tok123

If you did not ask for this, you can ignore this message.

Questions? Write to support@heat.example.",
}
`;

exports[`student-already-registered > matches the snapshot 1`] = `
{
  "subject": "You already have a HEAT account",
  "text": "HEAT

Hello Amina,

Someone tried to register for HEAT with this email address, which already has an account.

Sign in: https://learn.heat.example/sign-in

Reset your password: https://learn.heat.example/forgot-password

If this was not you, no action is needed.

Questions? Write to support@heat.example.",
}
`;

exports[`student-verification > matches the snapshot 1`] = `
{
  "subject": "Verify your email address for HEAT",
  "text": "HEAT

Hello Amina,

Thank you for registering for HEAT. Please confirm that this is your email address.

Verify your email: https://learn.heat.example/verify-email/tok123

If you did not register, you can ignore this message.

Questions? Write to support@heat.example.",
}
`;
